WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:15.200
Shri Mother, brothers and sisters,

00:22:16.020 --> 00:22:21.270
I think it has to be raised a little,
sound is not reaching people.

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:40.800
Shri Mother, brothers and sisters,
all seekers, people coming to Sahaja Yoga.

00:22:40.800 --> 00:22:46.860
I am from the west,
from the country of Canada

00:22:49.430 --> 00:22:58.920
that is very close to the country
of the United States of America.

00:22:58.920 --> 00:23:02.600
That country is the most powerful,
the most with material wealth,

00:23:02.600 --> 00:23:06.980
the most materially wealthy in the world.

00:23:10.860 --> 00:23:14.910
And people of the United States
of America

00:23:14.910 --> 00:23:23.860
are the most fearful and afraid people
in the world.

00:23:27.700 --> 00:23:32.020
They are afraid to walk
their own streets at night.

00:23:32.020 --> 00:23:38.020
They are afraid of an invasion
from by another country.

00:23:38.020 --> 00:23:49.950
And they’re afraid
of what’s inside themselves.

00:23:52.860 --> 00:23:57.420
I saw this with,
with all of the western countries.

00:23:57.420 --> 00:24:00.720
America is the worst
but all of the western countries

00:24:00.720 --> 00:24:04.740
and with all of the western people.

00:24:04.740 --> 00:24:13.020
And the western people are not simply
those who live in the west

00:24:13.020 --> 00:24:20.100
but those who have embraced
the values of the west.

00:24:24.620 --> 00:24:28.203
The values of the west
are material values,

00:24:28.203 --> 00:24:28.243
placing the material over the spiritual.

00:24:28.243 --> 00:24:43.560
And in taking the material,
grasping the material,

00:24:43.560 --> 00:24:50.730
we’ve also grasped that fear.

00:24:53.870 --> 00:25:01.250
We’re afraid of so many things.
We live our lives in fear.

00:25:06.470 --> 00:25:11.630
Most of us, when we come seeking
to Sahaja Yoga,

00:25:17.370 --> 00:25:20.010
some of that seeking is out of fear:

00:25:20.010 --> 00:25:25.440
what’s going to happen to us
if we don’t find something

00:25:25.440 --> 00:25:28.950
that can take care of our problems.

00:25:28.950 --> 00:25:33.990
Maybe we’re afraid of dying
from some disease that we’ve contracted;

00:25:33.990 --> 00:25:42.990
maybe we’re afraid of somehow losing
our own spirit

00:25:42.990 --> 00:25:49.200
through all the diseases,
spiritual diseases that are around us.

00:25:49.200 --> 00:26:00.770
So it’s essential and important
that for Sahaja Yoga

00:26:00.770 --> 00:26:09.980
be able to give us fearlessness,
courage, fortitude.

00:26:13.600 --> 00:26:18.130
In the Christian Bible there are
7 gifts of the Holy Spirit

00:26:18.130 --> 00:26:26.170
and the 4th gift, the gift of the heart,
is the gift of courage.

00:26:28.920 --> 00:26:32.730
That gift comes when you receive
the Holy Spirit,

00:26:32.730 --> 00:26:37.970
when you receive your Realisation.

00:26:40.610 --> 00:26:51.920
That gift comes with Sahaja Yoga;
that is the gift of the Goddess Herself.

00:26:57.740 --> 00:27:03.560
In the Hindu tradition,
you’re very fortunate to have the images,

00:27:06.210 --> 00:27:13.870
the personality of Shri Jagadamba,
Shri Durga,

00:27:16.960 --> 00:27:25.760
the all-powerful warrior goddess
who is afraid of nothing

00:27:28.700 --> 00:27:31.400
because She needs to be afraid
of nothing.

00:27:31.400 --> 00:27:39.140
There is nothing, no one,
more powerful than the Devi.

00:27:50.260 --> 00:27:56.470
We need then to awaken that Devi in us.

00:28:02.330 --> 00:28:09.800
If you’re new here,
if you’re not a Sahaj Yogi or Yogini

00:28:09.800 --> 00:28:16.760
then I invite you to look around
at the Sahaja Yogis and Yoginis

00:28:18.290 --> 00:28:31.080
that are here and see the gift
of courage, of confidence,

00:28:31.080 --> 00:28:36.720
of fearlessness that our Mother
has given us.

00:28:42.980 --> 00:28:53.280
All of us have overcome things
that we never would have believed

00:28:53.280 --> 00:28:55.680
we could have overcome
before we came to Sahaja Yoga.

00:28:55.680 --> 00:29:07.170
We’ve overcome emotional problems.
We’ve overcome physical problems.

00:29:10.170 --> 00:29:15.240
We’ve overcome problems that have been
with us for years and years and years.

00:29:18.960 --> 00:29:24.900
For me, it was difficult to stand up
before an audience and to speak.

00:29:24.900 --> 00:29:29.130
Now there’s no fear.
All I have is confidence.

00:29:29.130 --> 00:29:31.650
If Mother asks me to speak, I can speak.

00:29:31.650 --> 00:29:44.670
Whatever is asked of me in Sahaja
I can do

00:29:44.670 --> 00:29:56.560
and that’s because I’ve been given
something that’s inside myself

00:30:01.280 --> 00:30:02.900
and that’s very important.

00:30:02.900 --> 00:30:11.490
And here we have in Shri Mataji
the most important spiritual personality

00:30:11.490 --> 00:30:19.900
of this or any other age.
Just like that.

00:30:24.110 --> 00:30:38.510
But you don’t see Sahaja Yogis sitting,
simply sitting and worshiping Shri Mataji

00:30:38.510 --> 00:30:41.010
and to be taking.

00:30:41.010 --> 00:30:45.600
And we do take
and all we can do is take.

00:30:45.600 --> 00:30:49.860
But we worship in our action.

00:30:49.860 --> 00:30:57.210
Sahaja Yogi is not something
that teaches you how to sit,

00:30:57.210 --> 00:31:04.800
how to be passive, how to be happy.

00:31:04.800 --> 00:31:11.010
It’s something that teaches you
how to go and do.

00:31:11.010 --> 00:31:18.660
Sahaja Yoga is and will change
the entire world.

00:31:18.660 --> 00:31:27.810
It will change it in every aspect
and it will change us

00:31:27.810 --> 00:31:32.370
because we are given,
within each one of us,

00:31:32.370 --> 00:31:42.660
those qualities that Shri Mataji
represents as our ideal.

00:31:48.040 --> 00:31:55.480
We have within us, now awakened,
and for those of you

00:31:55.480 --> 00:31:59.560
who have not yet got your Realisation
will have it awakened tonight,

00:31:59.560 --> 00:32:05.650
we have within us the courage,
the confidence,

00:32:05.650 --> 00:32:10.720
the ability to deal with every problem
in this world.

00:32:10.720 --> 00:32:17.680
Nothing too big, nothing too insignificant,
it can be taken care of

00:32:21.260 --> 00:32:22.610
and we can do it.

00:32:22.610 --> 00:32:31.970
And, we can only do it
by surrendering the Ego

00:32:35.350 --> 00:32:41.080
and by allowing God,
by allowing Shri Mataji

00:32:41.080 --> 00:32:43.810
to work it out through us.

00:33:01.530 --> 00:33:11.520
Tonight, Mother will talk about the Devi
and where the Devi resides in our Chakra

00:33:11.520 --> 00:33:18.300
in the Centre Heart
and all the intricacies,

00:33:18.300 --> 00:33:26.700
the importance of that quality,
of that deity being awakened within us.

00:33:31.960 --> 00:33:39.680
And, you must remember that it is in you,
personally,

00:33:39.680 --> 00:33:48.230
for that courage, that confidence
has to be awakened.

00:33:52.410 --> 00:33:59.640
We all know the world has to change
and we all know

00:33:59.640 --> 00:34:01.830
that it has to begin with us,

00:34:01.830 --> 00:34:10.500
and you should all know
that it begins here, at Mother’s feet.

00:34:10.500 --> 00:35:08.160
Shri Mother….
(Applause)

00:35:14.490 --> 00:35:14.550
Lecture by HH Shri Mataji

00:35:14.550 --> 00:35:26.570
Today again I must thank Mrs. Venugopalan
for singing such a beautiful song

00:35:26.570 --> 00:35:28.250
about the Devi.

00:35:28.250 --> 00:35:35.300
I was very much impressed
the way Patrick told you

00:35:35.300 --> 00:35:42.170
that they are confident
that they can solve any problem.

00:35:42.170 --> 00:35:46.295
That’s what it has to be.

00:35:46.295 --> 00:35:56.690
That’s the sign of a Sahaja Yogi
who has reached a very great height

00:35:56.690 --> 00:36:10.480
in his understanding about himself
and about others.

00:36:10.480 --> 00:36:19.660
The Chakra of the Goddess lies
behind the sternum bone

00:36:22.810 --> 00:36:23.950
in the spinal cord.

00:36:28.720 --> 00:36:34.960
This Chakra is placed
above the Bhavasagara,

00:36:34.960 --> 00:36:38.530
above the Void,
as we call it in Sahaja Yoga.

00:36:38.530 --> 00:36:50.070
And the bridge that has to be crossed
by the bhaktas, by the seekers,

00:36:50.070 --> 00:36:58.380
is guarded by Her.

00:36:58.380 --> 00:37:09.390
She’s the one She helps Her children
to come through that passage

00:37:13.660 --> 00:37:20.350
when there are negative forces
trying to attack on a seeker.

00:37:21.790 --> 00:37:26.410
This chakra is placed at the back
of the sternum bone as I told you.

00:37:26.410 --> 00:37:38.500
In childhood the antibodies are formed
in the sternum bone.

00:37:41.840 --> 00:37:47.960
They are the warriors
or the Sainikas (soldiers) of the Devi.

00:37:47.960 --> 00:37:54.320
Until the age of 12 years
they grow and multiply,

00:37:54.320 --> 00:38:03.530
and ultimately they all get distributed
all over the body,

00:38:08.290 --> 00:38:16.060
and a human being is made able
to face any outside invasion on him.

00:38:24.700 --> 00:38:31.930
These antibodies know how to fight.

00:38:31.930 --> 00:38:41.050
They are extremely confident
and they know who are their enemies.

00:38:41.050 --> 00:38:47.680
They have all these messages
built in themselves.

00:38:47.680 --> 00:38:58.060
So when the anti-God element enters
into the being through any process,

00:38:58.060 --> 00:39:04.540
say, through food, through words,
through action,

00:39:04.540 --> 00:39:10.900
through devilish people or black magic,

00:39:10.900 --> 00:39:24.490
these antibodies combine together,
collectively fight the invaders.

00:39:30.510 --> 00:39:37.800
Those who do not have
their Central Heart properly developed

00:39:37.800 --> 00:39:42.060
suffer from tremendous insecurity
all their lives.

00:39:46.980 --> 00:39:56.280
When they are children,
you try to control them by frightening.

00:39:56.280 --> 00:40:04.110
These children later on become
extremely insecure.

00:40:04.110 --> 00:40:09.840
They are afraid of darkness,
they are afraid of night.

00:40:09.840 --> 00:40:13.140
Some of them are afraid of everything.

00:40:13.140 --> 00:40:23.040
Because the antibodies that are built
in the body are not sufficient in number

00:40:23.040 --> 00:40:35.650
and being this center so weak,
the person feels extremely insecure.

00:40:35.650 --> 00:40:42.460
Later on in life
when the child goes to the school

00:40:42.460 --> 00:40:52.050
or he tries to work out something
for the future,

00:40:55.840 --> 00:41:04.270
then also his confidence can be shaken
by parents, teachers, and outside people.

00:41:04.270 --> 00:41:10.480
So it is very important
to understand children who are growing.

00:41:10.480 --> 00:41:18.850
In the West they analyze everything
and try to put human beings

00:41:18.850 --> 00:41:19.930
into compartments.

00:41:23.360 --> 00:41:26.390
First the child is a child,
according to them,

00:41:26.390 --> 00:41:32.810
child has no innocence,
and he’s extremely selfish.

00:41:32.810 --> 00:41:42.470
Second part is adolescence,
which they think is a very arbitrary,

00:41:42.470 --> 00:41:46.520
moody stuff.

00:41:49.020 --> 00:41:54.780
In India, we do not know that there is
something like adolescence.

00:41:54.780 --> 00:42:04.170
Now these adolescent people form a group,
and they start criticizing

00:42:04.170 --> 00:42:06.120
or making fun of all the elders.

00:42:06.120 --> 00:42:09.570
At a very young age it starts.

00:42:13.720 --> 00:42:17.950
First they make fun of the teachers,
then of the parents,

00:42:17.950 --> 00:42:21.130
then of all the people
who are senior to them.

00:42:25.330 --> 00:42:28.720
They start becoming extremely active
in their brains

00:42:28.720 --> 00:42:31.630
because they see too many televisions
and things like that,

00:42:31.630 --> 00:42:41.380
and then they start behaving
at a very young age in such violent ways

00:42:41.380 --> 00:42:43.330
that one cannot imagine.

00:42:43.330 --> 00:42:48.700
I used to live about 25 miles
away from London

00:42:48.700 --> 00:42:52.660
and every time I would go to London,

00:42:52.660 --> 00:42:57.130
I would find some children
doing some sort of a mischief,

00:42:57.130 --> 00:42:57.700
somewhere.

00:42:57.700 --> 00:43:01.690
One day some of them entered
into my compartment

00:43:01.690 --> 00:43:08.560
and they started pulling out
all the covers,

00:43:08.560 --> 00:43:21.430
thrusting their knives into the seats,
opening out all the upholstery.

00:43:21.430 --> 00:43:23.890
I was just sitting and watching.

00:43:23.890 --> 00:43:27.340
So I said,
“Now are you tired? Please sit down.

00:43:27.340 --> 00:43:28.660
What’s the problem?”

00:43:28.660 --> 00:43:36.310
They said, “We are all very angry.”
I said, “For what? Why are you angry?”

00:43:36.310 --> 00:43:38.350
Said, “We are just angry.”
I said,

00:43:38.350 --> 00:43:40.810
“But you have to be angry for something.”

00:43:45.520 --> 00:43:49.840
They were children going to good schools
definitely, wearing very good clothes.

00:43:49.840 --> 00:43:57.790
And then I had to, when the train stopped,
I called the ticket collector

00:43:57.790 --> 00:44:02.020
and told him that these boys
have been doing all this hooliganic,

00:44:02.020 --> 00:44:05.620
hooliganism in the compartment
and you better look at it.

00:44:05.620 --> 00:44:10.390
And he came in and he said,
“This is a common thing”

00:44:10.390 --> 00:44:14.530
and then somehow or other
he took them out.

00:44:14.530 --> 00:44:18.850
But the only thing I felt about them is,
that all of them had

00:44:18.850 --> 00:44:20.470
their Center Heart catching.

00:44:20.470 --> 00:44:29.910
On the Kundalini, they were catching
their Center Heart.

00:44:29.910 --> 00:44:34.380
But when they saw Me, they sat down.
They were quiet, they listened to Me.

00:44:34.380 --> 00:44:38.310
I settled their Center Heart.

00:44:44.250 --> 00:44:47.160
And most of them said,
“We are angry with our mother.”

00:44:47.160 --> 00:44:51.330
“Why?”
“Because our brothers are angry.”

00:44:51.330 --> 00:44:52.920
“But why your brothers are angry?”

00:44:52.920 --> 00:44:59.820
Then I discovered that Freud has given
these funny ideas against the mother.

00:44:59.820 --> 00:45:04.830
Mother itself, can you imagine!
What a anti-God activity it is.

00:45:04.830 --> 00:45:15.000
To an Indian, mother is the primal thing,
any Indian,

00:45:15.000 --> 00:45:19.530
because his sense of security lies
in the mother.

00:45:19.530 --> 00:45:29.790
Even if the father is hot-tempered,
is angry, still they depend on the mother

00:45:32.910 --> 00:45:37.260
because mother knows when to get angry
and when not to get angry.

00:45:37.260 --> 00:45:42.600
She has the discrimination
and she is the one who protects them.

00:45:46.160 --> 00:45:51.290
The idea of mother is completely blasted
in the West

00:45:51.290 --> 00:45:56.750
and this is the reason why
the children of that country

00:45:56.750 --> 00:45:59.240
feel so insecure,
and when they grow

00:45:59.240 --> 00:46:00.890
they are extremely insecure.

00:46:00.890 --> 00:46:07.910
You won’t believe that all the time
they are polishing their brass,

00:46:07.910 --> 00:46:14.060
cleaning their house
but not even a rat enters their houses.

00:46:14.060 --> 00:46:20.120
And if they have to talk to someone,
they’ll make a person stand outside

00:46:20.120 --> 00:46:22.130
and talk from inside,
specially in London,

00:46:22.130 --> 00:46:26.300
because they are literally frightened.

00:46:26.300 --> 00:46:31.430
Nobody will believe, the British
who ruled us, are such frightened people.

00:46:31.430 --> 00:46:32.300
But they are.

00:46:32.300 --> 00:46:36.410
They are frightened of each other,
they are frightened of themselves.

00:46:36.410 --> 00:46:42.200
The reason is the Center Heart
is absolutely weak.

00:46:42.200 --> 00:46:48.140
I’ve told you the first reason,
the family insecurities.

00:46:48.140 --> 00:46:52.220
The child does not know
when he comes back from school,

00:46:52.220 --> 00:46:55.370
whether his mother would be there
or she would be gone.

00:46:55.370 --> 00:47:03.170
They don’t have mothers
who can bear a lot from the husbands

00:47:03.170 --> 00:47:09.620
and smile and show no signs
of their agony to their children.

00:47:09.620 --> 00:47:14.270
But the mothers in that country,
I’ve seen, always try to use

00:47:14.270 --> 00:47:19.160
their children from all kinds
of emotional blackmail, you can call it.

00:47:19.160 --> 00:47:24.560
They try to torture the child
by telling all the things

00:47:24.560 --> 00:47:27.740
the husband is doing to them
and whatever is the problem

00:47:27.740 --> 00:47:29.030
they are facing with the husbands.

00:47:31.610 --> 00:47:35.030
So the child is not secured
by the mother

00:47:35.030 --> 00:47:38.600
but on the contrary child starts
giving security to mothers there.

00:47:38.600 --> 00:47:45.410
At a very young age it starts
and the child becomes extremely negative

00:47:45.410 --> 00:47:46.850
and left-sided.

00:47:46.850 --> 00:47:51.800
He feels that he’s born in a place
full of hatred, insecurity and fear.

00:47:51.800 --> 00:47:59.480
When the bhaktas are born
in those countries

00:47:59.480 --> 00:48:05.990
they are also the same way
because they think if they have to go

00:48:05.990 --> 00:48:12.950
to a guru, the guru, as known so far,
tortures them or extracts all the money,

00:48:12.950 --> 00:48:19.010
takes their pareekshan, test,
and he sometimes leaves them

00:48:19.010 --> 00:48:20.480
high and dry on the streets.

00:48:20.480 --> 00:48:30.530
But in our country the Goddess
has taken Incarnation many a times.

00:48:30.530 --> 00:48:35.060
Thousands time She has taken
here Her birth,

00:48:35.060 --> 00:48:40.820
whenever the bhaktas called Her,
when they are pestered

00:48:40.820 --> 00:48:44.840
by the negative forces,
She came on this Earth to save them.

00:48:48.470 --> 00:48:54.740
These things used to be just accepted
by people

00:48:54.740 --> 00:49:03.110
but never were really accepted
in their hearts.

00:49:03.110 --> 00:49:07.670
People thought these are some sorts
of mythological stories

00:49:07.670 --> 00:49:12.140
that the Goddess came on this Earth
and She tried to save the people.

00:49:12.140 --> 00:49:17.510
They could not believe
that there could be a Shakti

00:49:17.510 --> 00:49:21.380
who could be born,
who could fight these horrible rakshasas

00:49:21.380 --> 00:49:29.600
and kill them, and save Her children,
Her bhaktas, from agony. It was too much.

00:49:29.600 --> 00:49:38.330
But today in Sahaja Yoga, you have seen
that when Kundalini rises

00:49:38.330 --> 00:49:44.420
and stops at the Center Nabhi,
you have to say the mantra

00:49:44.420 --> 00:49:48.020
of ‘Jagadamba’ and the Kundalini rises.

00:49:48.680 --> 00:49:53.120
That means, She resides
in the Center Heart

00:49:53.120 --> 00:50:05.060
and when She is being worshipped
the Kundalini rises.

00:50:05.060 --> 00:50:21.330
This center has got twelve petals
but the Goddess has thousand hands

00:50:21.330 --> 00:50:25.020
and thousand eyes.

00:50:27.700 --> 00:50:40.930
She has 16,000 Nadis to work out
Her different aspects of enlightenment.

00:50:40.930 --> 00:50:48.340
But the first thing She has to do,
through Her generosity and kindness

00:50:48.340 --> 00:50:56.530
and compassion and patience,
She has to suck in the sins,

00:50:56.530 --> 00:51:02.170
the Papavimochini,
the sins of human beings.

00:51:02.170 --> 00:51:11.755
One of the sentences in Bible was,
“Wages of fear is sin.”

00:51:11.755 --> 00:51:17.590
Or you can put it the other way round,
“The wages of sin is fear.”

00:51:24.010 --> 00:51:32.170
If you have fear you are committing
a sin against your Self and against God.

00:51:32.170 --> 00:51:40.300
Because, if Mother is Almighty
and She can solve all your problems,

00:51:40.300 --> 00:51:46.840
you are under Her protection,
then why should you have any fear?

00:51:46.840 --> 00:51:54.610
That means you do not believe
that She’s that powerful.

00:51:54.610 --> 00:52:02.290
When a person is frightened
this center starts breathing fast

00:52:02.290 --> 00:52:07.930
giving rhythmic instructions
to all the antibodies.

00:52:07.930 --> 00:52:15.880
With that you feel you are getting
a palpitation in the heart.

00:52:19.560 --> 00:52:25.980
This palpitation is nothing
but a signal to all the antibodies

00:52:25.980 --> 00:52:30.360
to fight the emergency of an attack.

00:52:36.520 --> 00:52:42.280
But when somebody builds up insecurity
later on in life

00:52:42.280 --> 00:52:46.660
it becomes a physical problem.

00:52:46.660 --> 00:52:52.870
If they have insecurities earlier
it is an emotional problem.

00:52:52.870 --> 00:53:02.740
But later on in life,
when one develops a insecurity, any kind,

00:53:02.740 --> 00:53:05.350
like a wife is insecure
about her husband;

00:53:05.350 --> 00:53:12.250
husband is a loafer or a bad man
and carrying on with other women,

00:53:12.250 --> 00:53:18.430
so the motherhood of the wife
is challenged.

00:53:18.430 --> 00:53:26.590
And when her motherhood is challenged,
she may get the weakening of this center

00:53:26.590 --> 00:53:31.300
by which she may suffer quite a lot
and may have even breast cancer.

00:53:31.300 --> 00:53:37.000
These insecurities can be also
self-made, imaginary.

00:53:37.000 --> 00:53:42.130
People can just think about it
and build up some sort of insecurities,

00:53:42.130 --> 00:53:48.580
which are of no actual existence.

00:53:48.580 --> 00:53:54.910
But such fears are very much more
in the West.

00:53:54.910 --> 00:54:02.140
Because the life in the West
has no mooring, has no explanation.

00:54:04.720 --> 00:54:07.180
Whatever you ask them, they’ll say,
“What’s wrong?”

00:54:07.180 --> 00:54:10.510
A husband will say, “What’s wrong?”
in having a keep.

00:54:10.510 --> 00:54:13.960
And the wife will also say, “All right,
if he wants to have a keep,

00:54:13.960 --> 00:54:14.710
let him have it.”

00:54:14.710 --> 00:54:18.670
In India, no woman would tolerate
such a situation.

00:54:18.670 --> 00:54:22.870
She would starve, she would do everything
but she will never touch a man

00:54:22.870 --> 00:54:23.740
who has a keep.

00:54:28.710 --> 00:54:34.200
So the basis of the strength
of Indian women

00:54:34.200 --> 00:54:37.290
is their sense of chastity.

00:54:37.290 --> 00:54:45.720
The sense of chastity
in the Indian women is so great

00:54:45.720 --> 00:54:51.210
that nothing can deter them
as long as they are chaste.

00:54:51.210 --> 00:54:59.220
But if they are not chaste,
then fear settles in them very fast.

00:54:59.220 --> 00:55:10.530
Chastity is the strength of women
and that’s why those women who have fear,

00:55:10.530 --> 00:55:15.330
mostly, have a problem
of their chastity being challenged.

00:55:15.330 --> 00:55:22.830
A woman who is frightened
that her chastity may be disturbed

00:55:22.830 --> 00:55:30.450
also can develop a problem
with the Heart Chakra.

00:55:33.170 --> 00:55:40.820
Such women can develop breast cancers,
breathing troubles

00:55:43.300 --> 00:55:49.790
and other kind of frightening diseases
on the emotional level also.

00:55:54.610 --> 00:55:59.320
This Chakra is ruined in women
when they lose their only child

00:55:59.320 --> 00:56:05.560
because their motherhood is finished
they feel

00:56:05.560 --> 00:56:10.060
and that is the worst thing
that can happen to a woman,

00:56:10.060 --> 00:56:11.020
if she’s a woman.

00:56:11.020 --> 00:56:14.770
But if she’s not a woman
she doesn’t feel much

00:56:14.770 --> 00:56:20.380
and she just behaves in a very manly way.

00:56:20.380 --> 00:56:25.450
And that’s what I’ve seen in the West,
that women really don’t much care

00:56:25.450 --> 00:56:31.900
when their children die,
but it is because they are not women.

00:56:31.900 --> 00:56:40.210
If you are a woman you definitely feel
for your children and their death.

00:56:40.210 --> 00:56:44.980
But after some time, such a woman
comes back again

00:56:44.980 --> 00:56:50.260
and she accepts the life as it is,
for the sake of her husband

00:56:50.260 --> 00:56:54.250
or may be if she has more relations
or other children.

00:56:54.250 --> 00:57:00.663
She becomes extremely powerful
as a reaction to what has happened

00:57:00.663 --> 00:57:00.670
to her.

00:57:00.670 --> 00:57:09.670
That’s only possible if your center
of Heart is all right.

00:57:09.670 --> 00:57:15.490
Such women do not grudge,
do not complain,

00:57:15.490 --> 00:57:19.000
are extremely serene
and can bear up lots of things.

00:57:19.000 --> 00:57:24.550
They are extremely tolerant
and can go to any extent

00:57:24.550 --> 00:57:31.030
to help their children
but they are never spoiling

00:57:31.030 --> 00:57:31.720
their children.

00:57:31.720 --> 00:57:36.310
They never spoil their children
because they understand

00:57:36.310 --> 00:57:38.920
spoiling is much worse
than beating the child.

00:57:38.920 --> 00:57:43.540
They never spoil the children
nor ever pamper them

00:57:43.540 --> 00:57:46.420
and never get dominated
by their children.

00:57:46.420 --> 00:57:51.940
They know, “I have to guide the child
and have to look after the child.”

00:57:51.940 --> 00:57:57.340
So, they look after all the ideals
and righteousness

00:57:57.340 --> 00:58:02.710
and the virtues of the child
and if he tries to get out of it,

00:58:02.710 --> 00:58:08.320
they go all out to win him over
back to virtue and to better life.

00:58:08.320 --> 00:58:14.560
But those people, those women,
who do not care

00:58:14.560 --> 00:58:20.950
for actual growth of the child,
may just avoid it and escape it.

00:58:20.950 --> 00:58:30.010
In the men, this chakra is caught up
if they have lost their mother very early

00:58:30.010 --> 00:58:33.820
or if their mother by chance
is a very cruel woman.

00:58:33.820 --> 00:58:42.430
Also this chakra can be caught up by men
if they have been to wars

00:58:42.430 --> 00:58:46.300
and if they have seen frightful things
in the war.

00:58:46.300 --> 00:58:57.280
Such people could be extremely emotional
and could be easily befooled by people

00:58:57.280 --> 00:59:00.400
who try to win over their emotions.

00:59:05.050 --> 00:59:07.960
What is to be done
to improve this chakra?

00:59:07.960 --> 00:59:14.860
In Sahaja Yoga, we have many techniques
by which we can improve this chakra

00:59:14.860 --> 00:59:17.590
and get your confidence back.

00:59:17.590 --> 00:59:23.260
As Patrick has said
that he never used to speak

00:59:23.260 --> 00:59:28.150
and I have seen many actors
who act very well and,

00:59:28.150 --> 00:59:31.030
when they came to My program, they said,

00:59:31.030 --> 00:59:34.570
“Mother please don’t ask us to speak
because we just don’t know how to speak.

00:59:34.570 --> 00:59:37.360
We can act
but we cannot speak to people.”

00:59:37.360 --> 00:59:40.420
They tried once and twice
and they ended up

00:59:40.420 --> 00:59:42.700
with two-three sentences,
mumbled down and sat down.

00:59:42.700 --> 00:59:51.730
I found out all of them
had this Chakra very badly damaged.

00:59:51.730 --> 00:59:56.380
Perhaps they lacked the love
of their mothers,

00:59:56.380 --> 01:00:02.050
perhaps they did not love their mothers
or perhaps, maybe, that they did not

01:00:02.050 --> 01:00:07.180
understand the value of virginity
in women.

01:00:07.180 --> 01:00:15.250
So those men, who try to look
at every woman who passes by,

01:00:15.250 --> 01:00:26.470
those men who try to have lusty eyes,
can also develop this center very badly

01:00:26.470 --> 01:00:31.360
and lots of problems can come
through this center.

01:00:31.360 --> 01:00:39.250
One of the problems that comes
through this could be lung cancer

01:00:40.270 --> 01:00:44.230
but I’ve seen this center
is very badly affected also

01:00:44.230 --> 01:00:46.450
by certain negligence in life.

01:00:46.450 --> 01:00:51.100
Like some people have a habit
of having a very hot bath,

01:00:51.100 --> 01:00:57.250
and then coming out of that hot bath
and enter into some cool place.

01:00:57.250 --> 01:01:04.960
Such people will catch this center
very badly and they will have a problem.

01:01:04.960 --> 01:01:08.080
Then there’s another thing,
which is looks very simple

01:01:08.080 --> 01:01:12.820
but many people have a habit in,
specially summers, to wear

01:01:12.820 --> 01:01:20.140
a one single kurta or a single shirt
and not the under-shirt.

01:01:20.140 --> 01:01:24.910
This is also not proper.

01:01:24.910 --> 01:01:29.200
A man must always have something
under his shirt,

01:01:29.200 --> 01:01:35.140
otherwise when it starts perspiring,
he can get trouble

01:01:35.140 --> 01:01:38.200
into this Heart Center.

01:01:38.200 --> 01:01:43.030
This Heart Center is caught up
by various emotional problems

01:01:43.030 --> 01:01:44.170
in human beings.

01:01:44.170 --> 01:01:49.720
Husband and wife, if they all the time
quarrel, there’s always quarrelling

01:01:49.720 --> 01:01:52.660
in the house, specially if the mother
is very dominating,

01:01:52.660 --> 01:01:54.730
the child develops this center.

01:01:54.730 --> 01:01:59.950
And if the father is very dominating,
the child develops this,

01:01:59.950 --> 01:02:01.240
the Heart itself.

01:02:01.240 --> 01:02:06.700
So it is very important
that husband and wife

01:02:06.700 --> 01:02:11.940
should never quarrel
in the presence of their children.

01:02:11.940 --> 01:02:17.790
Now there resides in this center,
the Incarnation of the Goddess,

01:02:17.790 --> 01:02:25.830
who came on this Earth thousands of time
and She resides there for your protection

01:02:25.830 --> 01:02:30.630
but first of all you have to be worthy
of Her protection.

01:02:30.630 --> 01:02:37.560
When She came on this Earth many a times,
you know, Her body was made

01:02:37.560 --> 01:02:43.410
by various forces, as if She was
like a bubble and the bubble was covered

01:02:43.410 --> 01:02:49.860
by so many things added onto that
and that’s how She got lots of things

01:02:49.860 --> 01:02:53.490
from various Gods.

01:02:53.490 --> 01:02:58.200
Like Her hair She got from Yama,
the God of Death;

01:02:58.200 --> 01:03:12.060
Her nose She got from the God of Wealth,
Kubera and Her ears She got

01:03:12.060 --> 01:03:15.540
from the Pavana, that is Air.

01:03:15.540 --> 01:03:23.490
Like that, Her body was made specially
by the Essences of these Great Deities,

01:03:23.490 --> 01:03:26.460
who donated their Essences
to the Goddess,

01:03:26.460 --> 01:03:30.780
to be equipped to do
these multifarious activities.

01:03:30.780 --> 01:03:37.560
Now the first activity, as I told you,
of the Goddess is to save Her children

01:03:37.560 --> 01:03:39.000
from the negative forces.

01:03:39.000 --> 01:03:49.230
So She looks extremely mild, sweet
but She can be extremely violent,

01:03:49.230 --> 01:03:55.770
in the sense, She can kill or crush
anyone who tries to overpower

01:03:55.770 --> 01:03:59.883
Her children,
Atisaumya – Atiraudra

01:03:59.883 --> 01:04:00.570
(Extremely gentle like the Moon
or Extremely terrible like Rudra),

01:04:01.230 --> 01:04:09.060
these two temperaments exist only
in the Goddess because She is the Mother

01:04:09.060 --> 01:04:12.960
and at any cost She wants
to save Her child.

01:04:12.960 --> 01:04:17.520
Also towards Her child
when he goes beyond a point

01:04:17.520 --> 01:04:21.690
of understanding,
when he shows no sense of discipline,

01:04:21.690 --> 01:04:28.350
then also Goddess can pull him down
by certain methods that She adopts.

01:04:28.350 --> 01:04:35.700
Now first of all is that She gives
all that is needed to remove the fear

01:04:35.700 --> 01:04:37.740
from the mind of sadhakas.

01:04:37.740 --> 01:04:47.910
Secondly, She cures this center
by giving birth to additional antibodies

01:04:47.910 --> 01:04:59.070
in the body and by vibrating
the tired antibodies to act in a way

01:04:59.070 --> 01:05:08.620
that they can fight back again.

01:05:08.620 --> 01:05:14.080
Even in day-to-day life,
She may establish Her existence

01:05:14.080 --> 01:05:18.760
by showing lots of miracles
to Her children.

01:05:18.760 --> 01:05:24.760
We had a lady coming to see Me
and she was rather late.

01:05:24.760 --> 01:05:28.810
And when she came back
I asked her what was the problem,

01:05:28.810 --> 01:05:33.250
she said, “No, there was no problem
but my bus fell down

01:05:33.250 --> 01:05:40.570
about 20-30 feet down,
and the thing rolled down

01:05:40.570 --> 01:05:45.520
and fell on the ground
with all the four legs intact.

01:05:45.520 --> 01:05:49.000
And all of us in the bus were saved.

01:05:49.000 --> 01:05:53.875
But the driver got upset
and he ran away.

01:05:53.875 --> 01:06:00.190
So somebody who was in the car,
who knew how to drive came down

01:06:00.190 --> 01:06:04.210
and he start, switched on the car
and the car started moving.

01:06:04.210 --> 01:06:07.900
And we came back then to Bombay.”

01:06:07.900 --> 01:06:12.160
So, on the way they started asking,
“There must be some saint sitting here,

01:06:12.160 --> 01:06:17.320
otherwise how can we be protected?
Only a saint can protect us like this.”

01:06:17.320 --> 01:06:20.830
And she was wearing my ring.
“Oh!” they said

01:06:20.830 --> 01:06:22.210
“This is Mataji’s disciple.”

01:06:22.210 --> 01:06:26.140
They all started falling at her feet,
saying, “Oh! You have saved us,

01:06:26.140 --> 01:06:27.100
you have saved us.”

01:06:27.100 --> 01:06:30.550
So, there are many miracles
that take place in your life.

01:06:30.550 --> 01:06:35.140
When you see an accident taking place,
suddenly you find the accident is over.

01:06:35.140 --> 01:06:39.670
There was one fellow,
was a journalist called Marathe.

01:06:39.670 --> 01:06:43.780
He and his friend, another journalist,
were coming from Lonavla down

01:06:44.290 --> 01:06:51.820
and it’s a very big sloppy road, ghat,
and their brakes failed.

01:06:52.600 --> 01:06:54.700
And the driver said,
“Now the brakes have failed

01:06:54.700 --> 01:06:55.720
and you take God’s name.”

01:06:55.720 --> 01:06:59.560
And they started remembering
their Mother.

01:06:59.560 --> 01:07:04.510
And suddenly they saw
a big truck coming ahead,

01:07:04.510 --> 01:07:07.660
they were about to bang onto that,
they closed their eyes.

01:07:07.660 --> 01:07:12.190
And God knows what happened,
they opened the eyes

01:07:12.190 --> 01:07:16.930
and saw the truck was going upward
and they were moving forward

01:07:16.930 --> 01:07:17.770
without any difficulties.

01:07:17.770 --> 01:07:23.170
And they were amazed how it has happened,
as if somebody has lifted their car

01:07:23.170 --> 01:07:25.630
and put before the truck,
and they have been saved.

01:07:25.630 --> 01:07:29.410
And the driver also closed his eyes
and took the name of the Mother.

01:07:29.410 --> 01:07:33.010
It is possible! It has happened
with so many people

01:07:33.010 --> 01:07:37.750
that they do not know how it works out.

01:07:37.750 --> 01:07:41.290
So one has to believe that we have
the Mother within ourselves,

01:07:41.290 --> 01:07:45.730
in our heart and if She’s awakened,
She is going to look after us.

01:07:45.730 --> 01:07:50.560
She is going to give all the protection
that is needed and there’s nothing

01:07:50.560 --> 01:07:52.240
to be frightened of anything.

01:07:52.240 --> 01:07:59.290
But you can imagine, as Patrick has said
clearly, that they were quite frightened

01:07:59.290 --> 01:08:00.130
and I know they are.

01:08:00.130 --> 01:08:02.470
Even English language is like that.

01:08:02.470 --> 01:08:07.060
All the time they’ll say, “I am afraid.”
“I am afraid I have to go.”

01:08:07.060 --> 01:08:10.011
What is there to be afraid,
if you have to go, you better go.

01:08:10.011 --> 01:08:14.290
“I am afraid, if I am doing…”

01:08:14.290 --> 01:08:18.130
They are all the time jittery like that
and so jittery and when they talk,

01:08:18.130 --> 01:08:21.100
you know, they are so frightened
that sometimes you feel nervous

01:08:21.100 --> 01:08:23.710
with them, that you, you do not know
how to approach them,

01:08:23.710 --> 01:08:24.580
the way they are nervous.

01:08:24.580 --> 01:08:28.570
And one of the reasons why
they are nervous is that,

01:08:28.570 --> 01:08:32.620
because they plan too much,
think too much, analyze too much

01:08:32.620 --> 01:08:36.010
and then ego settles down
into their brains

01:08:36.010 --> 01:08:37.930
and ultimately covers the heart.

01:08:37.930 --> 01:08:43.240
Because their ego covers their heart
they get a fright.

01:08:43.240 --> 01:08:46.750
Actually it so happens that if you
become ego-oriented

01:08:46.750 --> 01:08:48.550
you start seeing yourself through.

01:08:48.550 --> 01:08:57.340
Because when you are at a level,
you can even see your ego very clearly

01:08:57.340 --> 01:09:00.700
and then you get frightened
of other people because you think

01:09:00.700 --> 01:09:04.090
they too also must be having
the same type of an ego

01:09:04.090 --> 01:09:07.315
and you are really frightened of it.

01:09:07.315 --> 01:09:11.050
It is very common also in the East.

01:09:11.050 --> 01:09:14.290
Now in India, I should say,
that supposing you have to go

01:09:14.290 --> 01:09:16.390
to a government office, be careful.

01:09:18.220 --> 01:09:21.910
Ah, anybody, even a chaparaasee
(peon/office boy) can shout at you

01:09:21.910 --> 01:09:22.600
for nothing at all.

01:09:22.600 --> 01:09:27.070
They develop a system of barking
all the time, just go on barking.

01:09:27.070 --> 01:09:32.170
The reason is they bark at you
because they themselves are insecure.

01:09:32.170 --> 01:09:34.600
A chaparaasee is insecure of his boss,
his boss is insecure of his boss,

01:09:34.600 --> 01:09:41.050
his boss is insecure of his boss,
ultimately the minister is afraid

01:09:41.050 --> 01:09:43.870
of the voters and the voters are afraid
of the minister.

01:09:43.870 --> 01:09:44.920
It’s such a vicious circle.

01:09:44.920 --> 01:09:49.630
So the whole system works out
into such a terrible insecurity

01:09:49.630 --> 01:09:49.845
(Shri Mataji laughing)
that you don’t understand

01:09:49.845 --> 01:09:53.860
what is there to bark at?
What is there to shout at?

01:09:55.720 --> 01:10:05.410
And then a kind of a, identification
with the falsehood is built up so much

01:10:05.410 --> 01:10:09.280
that you are no more a human being;
you are either a secretary

01:10:09.280 --> 01:10:13.633
or you are an under-secretary
or a joint secretary, I do not know

01:10:13.633 --> 01:10:13.660
who is higher who is lower.

01:10:13.660 --> 01:10:16.750
And then you have a,
some other secretaries

01:10:16.750 --> 01:10:21.790
and then you have clerks,
and this and that and that.

01:10:21.790 --> 01:10:24.310
And you are that,
you are nothing else but that!

01:10:24.310 --> 01:10:28.870
So, because you are that
you must have these horns

01:10:28.870 --> 01:10:31.570
and you must shout at people
otherwise nobody is going to believe

01:10:31.570 --> 01:10:32.410
that you are something.

01:10:32.410 --> 01:10:36.820
So it is such an identification
that develops into human beings,

01:10:36.820 --> 01:10:40.420
that too because of this heart
not being developed properly.

01:10:40.420 --> 01:10:46.360
Because if your heart is developed
properly then you are a human being

01:10:46.360 --> 01:10:48.850
because you know your Mother
has given you the birth

01:10:48.850 --> 01:10:50.950
and you are a human being.

01:10:50.950 --> 01:10:55.240
It is, there’s no need to have any fear
from another human being

01:10:55.240 --> 01:10:57.820
who is also a child of your Mother.

01:10:57.820 --> 01:11:01.330
So there has to be no fear about it.

01:11:01.330 --> 01:11:06.520
But the trouble is that
when human beings start wearing anything,

01:11:06.520 --> 01:11:09.760
supposing they wear a suit,
immediately they’ll start speaking

01:11:09.760 --> 01:11:10.270
in English.

01:11:10.270 --> 01:11:17.950
As soon as they wear pajamas,
they start speaking in Hindi language

01:11:17.950 --> 01:11:22.720
or say, dhoti, Hindi language
and pajamas, they might start giving

01:11:22.720 --> 01:11:23.230
[SOUNDS LIKE galis].

01:11:23.230 --> 01:11:30.580
So it is a kind of a very superficial
identification human beings develop

01:11:30.580 --> 01:11:32.350
because there is no depth in the heart.

01:11:32.350 --> 01:11:36.010
If they had that depth,
that mooring in the heart,

01:11:36.010 --> 01:11:39.220
then they would not develop
these superficial things.

01:11:39.220 --> 01:11:41.710
And as a result of that,
they are frightened

01:11:41.710 --> 01:11:45.640
because they know they are superficial,
others are superficial,

01:11:45.640 --> 01:11:47.950
they have got beard, we have got beard.

01:11:47.950 --> 01:11:50.860
So they’ll quarrel,
if I am going to pull his beard,

01:11:50.860 --> 01:11:52.090
he might pull my beard as well.

01:11:52.090 --> 01:11:55.810
Such a fear exist among human beings.

01:11:55.810 --> 01:12:01.060
And then, another thing, another steps
come into the minds of the people

01:12:01.060 --> 01:12:03.670
that why not pull his legs to go up?

01:12:03.670 --> 01:12:08.830
This is the third category of debasement.

01:12:08.830 --> 01:12:16.690
If you are the child of the same Mother
how can you go higher than anybody else?

01:12:16.690 --> 01:12:20.740
You will remain always
the child of the Mother.

01:12:20.740 --> 01:12:25.120
How can you go higher
than any other child

01:12:25.120 --> 01:12:27.130
in the eyes of Mother? You cannot.

01:12:27.130 --> 01:12:32.770
On the contrary if you try to do
such tricks the Mother will punish you.

01:12:32.770 --> 01:12:37.180
And this is the second thing
that Mother does,

01:12:37.180 --> 01:12:39.610
is to punish Her children.

01:12:39.610 --> 01:12:45.620
Yes, She punishes in very sweet ways
first of all.

01:12:45.620 --> 01:12:49.669
For example, if the child is not eating
and troubling, She said, “All right,

01:12:49.669 --> 01:12:51.829
you don’t want to eat, all right,
don’t eat.”

01:12:51.830 --> 01:12:56.570
That’s a very simple way
of punishing children.

01:12:56.570 --> 01:13:01.220
But then She says, “All right
you want to have the way

01:13:01.220 --> 01:13:02.360
you want to have, go ahead.”

01:13:02.360 --> 01:13:08.300
Like I tell them not to do
such and such thing, it’s not good.

01:13:08.300 --> 01:13:12.560
For example, I told them
that don’t change the flats

01:13:12.560 --> 01:13:17.209
just from the beginning
and let the all the Sahaja Yogis

01:13:17.209 --> 01:13:18.829
stay with other Sahaja Yogis.

01:13:18.830 --> 01:13:23.959
But the organizers thought
it’s better to take the flats,

01:13:23.959 --> 01:13:28.849
whatever may be the reason,
because they are very wise organizers!

01:13:28.850 --> 01:13:32.570
But, you see, Mother says something
very simple but it has a meaning,

01:13:32.570 --> 01:13:33.290
one must know.

01:13:33.290 --> 01:13:37.265
And they arranged it that way.

01:13:37.265 --> 01:13:42.470
So, half of the people just protested
that, “No, we are going to see,

01:13:42.470 --> 01:13:44.630
stay with some Sahaja Yogis,
we want to be with them.”

01:13:44.630 --> 01:13:45.709
So they were accommodating.

01:13:45.709 --> 01:13:49.699
The others were, British, you know,
nowadays are on the other side

01:13:49.700 --> 01:13:51.950
of the mood.

01:13:51.950 --> 01:13:58.610
They are very, very tolerant
and they said, “All right,

01:13:58.610 --> 01:14:01.340
if we are not arranged,
we’ll stay in the flats.”

01:14:01.340 --> 01:14:03.890
So they stayed in the flats.
But what happened?

01:14:03.890 --> 01:14:06.560
It rained and rained and rained
and rained

01:14:06.560 --> 01:14:11.959
and they could not arrange their food
even under the roof they had built.

01:14:11.959 --> 01:14:17.539
So they had to shift, all of them,
to other places, and all of them

01:14:17.540 --> 01:14:20.360
had to stay with other Sahaja Yogis,
as told by Mother.

01:14:20.360 --> 01:14:24.410
If they had listened to the Mother,
they would have saved some money

01:14:24.410 --> 01:14:27.115
as well as they would have saved
some trouble

01:14:27.115 --> 01:14:29.959
and there would have been
no problem at all.

01:14:29.959 --> 01:14:34.609
That’s how little tricks here and there
are played by Mother

01:14:34.610 --> 01:14:38.250
just to convince the children
that you have been stupid.

01:14:38.250 --> 01:14:46.740
Now, there are so many things like that
which Mother can play

01:14:46.740 --> 01:14:51.959
and Her playfulness is very important
in life

01:14:51.959 --> 01:14:56.879
because if She is severe
with the children, they’ll run away.

01:14:56.880 --> 01:15:02.400
If She’s like any other guru,
the gurus, the satgurus also,

01:15:02.400 --> 01:15:05.040
they used to beat their disciples.

01:15:05.040 --> 01:15:08.520
They used to hang them by a string!

01:15:08.520 --> 01:15:12.689
You don’t know how the gurus
treat their disciples!

01:15:12.689 --> 01:15:16.049
Some of them take lots of money
from their disciples

01:15:16.050 --> 01:15:20.490
and some of them take lots of, aa,
things from their disciple.

01:15:20.490 --> 01:15:24.959
They want complete surrendering
and they make them subservient.

01:15:24.959 --> 01:15:29.309
They really torture the lives
of their children,

01:15:29.310 --> 01:15:32.610
of their disciples we should say.

01:15:32.610 --> 01:15:37.650
But the Mother doesn’t want to do that
so she plays little tricks here and there

01:15:37.650 --> 01:15:39.630
and tries to correct the children.

01:15:39.630 --> 01:15:47.130
Now I’ll give you an example of a guru
whom I met about five-six years back.

01:15:47.130 --> 01:15:53.189
He came from Amarnath to a small village,
small district place near Bombay,

01:15:53.189 --> 01:15:55.649
where a Sahaja Yogini was staying.

01:15:55.650 --> 01:15:59.400
And, he sent his disciple
who was staying in that place

01:15:59.400 --> 01:16:03.780
to see that Sahaja Yogini
and she, he went in and told that,

01:16:03.780 --> 01:16:07.800
“You see, my Guru is coming
and he wants to see Mataji

01:16:07.800 --> 01:16:13.169
and he has told me that only Adi Shakti
will clear out my Agnya Chakra.”

01:16:13.169 --> 01:16:17.009
So, she couldn’t understand, she said,
“What is your Guru doing?”

01:16:17.010 --> 01:16:18.900
“Oh, God, don’t talk about him.”

01:16:18.900 --> 01:16:23.310
He held his ears, “Don’t take his name.
Oh, you can’t know how,

01:16:23.310 --> 01:16:25.140
what sort of a person he is.” he said.

01:16:25.140 --> 01:16:27.209
“But why doesn’t he open
your Agnya Chakra?

01:16:27.209 --> 01:16:31.529
Mother will be coming
but of course why shouldn’t you do that?”

01:16:31.530 --> 01:16:34.380
He said, “No, no, no, no!
He said only She should open,

01:16:34.380 --> 01:16:35.610
nobody else should open it.

01:16:35.610 --> 01:16:42.240
And he sent me to this place
about five years back, saying that

01:16:42.240 --> 01:16:45.720
in the sixth year Adi Shakti
will be coming and She’ll open

01:16:45.720 --> 01:16:47.590
your Agnya Chakra.”
Now can you believe it?

01:16:47.590 --> 01:16:50.830
Poor fellow suffering from that horrid
Agnya Chakra, was suffering

01:16:52.360 --> 01:16:53.920
when this guru had come.

01:16:53.920 --> 01:16:58.240
So he came to see Me and he told Me,
“Mother, my Guru has come

01:16:58.240 --> 01:17:00.305
and he wants to see You.”
So I went to see him.

01:17:00.305 --> 01:17:05.770
And, this guru was sitting down there
with a big temper, you see,

01:17:05.770 --> 01:17:07.030
the nose were all bloating.

01:17:07.030 --> 01:17:10.120
Of course, when I went there
he touched My feet and everything,

01:17:10.120 --> 01:17:14.890
and then he called one very bad name
to this thing, “Did he go,

01:17:14.890 --> 01:17:16.480
did he touch Your feet?
Was he all right?

01:17:16.480 --> 01:17:17.740
Was he behaving all right?”

01:17:17.740 --> 01:17:20.800
I said, “He was all right,
but I can’t understand why did you not

01:17:20.800 --> 01:17:21.700
open his Agnya Chakra?”

01:17:21.700 --> 01:17:26.140
He said, “Let him go to hell now.
I am not going to open his Agnya Chakra.

01:17:26.140 --> 01:17:29.140
who opened my Agnya Chakra?
Why should I open his Agnya Chakra?”

01:17:29.140 --> 01:17:34.270
So I said, “This is not good,
I should open.”

01:17:34.270 --> 01:17:36.940
“Yes, yes, you will because you are
a Mother. I am not a Mother.”

01:17:36.940 --> 01:17:47.440
So he went inside and the disciple
told Me, “Mother, he hanged me by legs

01:17:47.440 --> 01:17:51.670
on top of this well,
for three days I was hanging there.”

01:17:51.670 --> 01:17:54.400
I said, “For what?
Why did he hang you there?”

01:17:54.400 --> 01:17:58.210
You said you said, she (he) said,
“Don’t ask any one.”

01:17:58.210 --> 01:18:01.930
Then he came in, “Yes, yes, I hanged you!
Yes, I will, again!”

01:18:01.930 --> 01:18:06.880
So I said, “Why did you hang him?”
“He was smoking, because he was smoking,

01:18:06.880 --> 01:18:08.470
I hanged him there.”
I said, “Now smoke.”

01:18:08.470 --> 01:18:12.760
And, I was putting him down, up and down.
I said, “I am smoking you.”

01:18:12.760 --> 01:18:16.660
And he tortured him like this.
I said, “But why should you do

01:18:16.660 --> 01:18:17.440
such a horrible thing?”

01:18:17.440 --> 01:18:21.340
He says, “Otherwise how will you
discipline? I am not a Mother.

01:18:21.340 --> 01:18:23.530
I don’t know how to discipline.
This is the only way

01:18:23.530 --> 01:18:24.370
I can discipline him.”

01:18:24.370 --> 01:18:27.755
And he said, “You go on spoiling him
but I am going to discipline him

01:18:27.755 --> 01:18:27.970
like that.”

01:18:27.970 --> 01:18:31.270
“All right,” I said, “you shut up now,
just now don’t talk, ba-ba,

01:18:31.270 --> 01:18:32.680
let Me put his Agnya right.”

01:18:32.680 --> 01:18:35.260
And I took about two minutes
to put his Agnya right.

01:18:35.260 --> 01:18:38.620
I said, “His Agnya is all right now”,
ah, then he said, “Did he promise You

01:18:38.620 --> 01:18:40.420
that he will not smoke?”
I said, “He did not.”

01:18:40.420 --> 01:18:45.550
So he said, “You better ask him
to promise otherwise I will not allow

01:18:45.550 --> 01:18:46.840
him to eat his food for three days.”

01:18:49.630 --> 01:18:54.160
I said, “Ba-ba, this is a horrible guru,
God save this disciple from this guru.

01:18:54.160 --> 01:18:54.189
(Shri Mataji laughs.)

01:18:54.189 --> 01:18:59.259
But, you see, what he was meaning
that there should be a discipline

01:18:59.260 --> 01:19:01.510
in a disciple.

01:19:01.510 --> 01:19:08.500
There has to be a complete understanding
that he is the guru.

01:19:08.500 --> 01:19:12.430
But he said, “Look at these people.
How are they?

01:19:12.430 --> 01:19:15.400
They take liberties with You,
they trouble You so much, eh,

01:19:15.400 --> 01:19:18.640
they try to be funny with You,
still You don’t say anything to them.”

01:19:18.640 --> 01:19:22.300
I said, “I don’t have to say;
I know how to correct them.”

01:19:22.300 --> 01:19:26.530
So this is the quality of the Mother,
who can correct people.

01:19:26.530 --> 01:19:30.760
She knows who doubts them,
She knows who thinks, aah,

01:19:30.760 --> 01:19:35.140
who thinks wrong about Her,
She knows who thinks rightly about Her.

01:19:35.140 --> 01:19:37.930
She knows everything!
If She knows everything

01:19:37.930 --> 01:19:39.100
She doesn’t have to worry.

01:19:39.100 --> 01:19:42.850
She is completely secure about it
and She doesn’t have the insecurity

01:19:42.850 --> 01:19:46.780
of the guru that one day the disciple
will misbehave or anything,

01:19:46.780 --> 01:19:48.370
because She knows how to correct.

01:19:48.370 --> 01:19:53.680
The other day I met one gentleman,
a Sahaja Yogi, and he came to Me

01:19:53.680 --> 01:19:57.100
and he started explaining to Me,
“Mother, You don’t know, this happened…”

01:19:57.100 --> 01:19:58.689
I said, “Now, I don’t know anything,
isn’t it?

01:19:58.689 --> 01:20:01.479
You think I don’t know anything?”
He said, “Yes Mother, how will You know?”

01:20:01.479 --> 01:20:05.799
I said, I said, “I’ll tell you one thing,
that you pay, you played lot of cricket

01:20:05.800 --> 01:20:08.290
in your childhood
until you came to Sahaja Yoga.”

01:20:08.290 --> 01:20:11.140
“Yes, that’s true. How do You know?”
I said, “That’s how I know.”

01:20:12.900 --> 01:20:15.180
So I know or not, then you know.

01:20:15.180 --> 01:20:18.570
Then he accepted, “All right, You know,
Mother, all about me,

01:20:18.570 --> 01:20:20.550
I don’t know how You know.”

01:20:20.550 --> 01:20:24.540
But, She’s Avalokiteshvari,
She’s the One-Who-Sees-Everything.

01:20:24.540 --> 01:20:26.910
She knows, somehow or the other,
She knows.

01:20:26.910 --> 01:20:29.460
How She knows, that cannot be explained
at this stage

01:20:29.460 --> 01:20:33.090
but She knows each and everything
what you are doing, if She wants to.

01:20:33.090 --> 01:20:38.460
And the third quality of a Mother
is that She’s a Maha-Maya.

01:20:38.460 --> 01:20:44.490
She talks like you, sits like you, ah,
She’ll behave like you, ah,

01:20:44.490 --> 01:20:46.230
everything will be just like you.

01:20:46.230 --> 01:20:50.700
And you won’t be able to make out
the depth of this woman,

01:20:50.700 --> 01:20:55.320
who is a Maha-Maya
because She plays such tricks on you

01:20:55.320 --> 01:21:00.180
and such thing in such a beautiful way
that you cannot make it out.

01:21:00.180 --> 01:21:02.100
You think that you’re all right.

01:21:02.100 --> 01:21:06.120
You go to a person, ah,
and you tell anything you feel like

01:21:06.120 --> 01:21:10.800
about Mother, you try to do anything
and ultimately you discover

01:21:10.800 --> 01:21:12.210
that everything She knows!

01:21:12.210 --> 01:21:17.910
And when you discover that,
gradually you start understanding that,

01:21:17.910 --> 01:21:21.180
“When She knows everything about me,
I better be all right.”

01:21:21.180 --> 01:21:24.810
And how does She know?
Because She resides

01:21:24.810 --> 01:21:26.670
in your Center Heart.

01:21:26.670 --> 01:21:30.450
She knows everything
what you have been doing,

01:21:30.450 --> 01:21:34.140
what you are doing,
what you’re thinking of doing.

01:21:34.140 --> 01:21:36.360
So She what does She do?
“Sankalpa vikalpa karoti”

01:21:36.360 --> 01:21:39.780
[One o=intention, doubts occur ],
whatever ‘sankalpas’ [intention]

01:21:39.780 --> 01:21:41.340
you are making, She’ll make it fall.

01:21:41.340 --> 01:21:44.640
If you say, “Now, I have decided,
Mother, to do this

01:21:44.640 --> 01:21:46.140
and I’m going to do it.”

01:21:46.140 --> 01:21:52.860
It will fail. You have to judge yourself
as a real son of your Mother.

01:21:52.860 --> 01:21:57.840
As in Bombay or any place
we tried to get some land.

01:21:57.840 --> 01:22:00.360
Nobody could get it.
“We tried, tried, tried, you see.

01:22:00.360 --> 01:22:02.730
This is black market money,
bribery, corruption.”

01:22:02.730 --> 01:22:05.490
I said, “Nothing doing,
I’m not going to do any of those things.”

01:22:05.490 --> 01:22:08.310
So then said, “Then Mother,
how are we to achieve it?”

01:22:08.310 --> 01:22:10.530
I said, “You will achieve it,
don’t you worry.”

01:22:10.530 --> 01:22:13.620
Then they started saying,
“She’s not practical, She’s this,

01:22:13.620 --> 01:22:14.340
She’s that.”

01:22:14.340 --> 01:22:17.580
And everybody, who said, turned out
to be very impractical.

01:22:17.580 --> 01:22:21.810
“Ultimately”, I said,
“When you will be ready for Sahaja Yoga

01:22:21.810 --> 01:22:24.780
then you’ll get the land and the Ashram.”

01:22:24.780 --> 01:22:27.420
Because once you start an Ashram
and have some money there

01:22:27.420 --> 01:22:29.940
you’ll find all kinds of bhoots
will join together

01:22:29.940 --> 01:22:33.270
and will make fun with the money
that has been collected.

01:22:33.270 --> 01:22:37.350
There won’t be any proper arrangement,
no proper discipline.

01:22:37.350 --> 01:22:42.447
And that is why the time
has to be given for children

01:22:42.447 --> 01:22:47.850
to learn through making errors,
through making mistakes

01:22:47.850 --> 01:22:50.880
and understanding what mistakes
we are making and,

01:22:50.880 --> 01:22:52.860
how we have to correct it.

01:22:52.860 --> 01:22:57.180
Once they start understanding it,
then it is very easy, very easy

01:22:57.180 --> 01:23:01.920
to communicate to them
what they are supposed to do,

01:23:01.920 --> 01:23:06.720
what they have done is wrong
and how to correct it.

01:23:06.720 --> 01:23:09.120
But as long as they think
they are very wise,

01:23:09.120 --> 01:23:12.810
as long as they think they are
extremely nice people

01:23:12.810 --> 01:23:16.620
and that they are on their own,
Mother says, “All right, go ahead,

01:23:16.620 --> 01:23:17.490
doesn’t matter.”

01:23:17.490 --> 01:23:23.130
Now you must know that Mother
has saved people from that Bhavasagara

01:23:23.130 --> 01:23:25.230
with such great difficulty.

01:23:25.230 --> 01:23:28.350
It’s not easy to do that,
it’s a tremendous task.

01:23:28.350 --> 01:23:33.600
Sometimes to raise the Kundalini
of thousands of people, I feel like, ah,

01:23:33.600 --> 01:23:37.905
a big mountain I have to raise.

01:23:37.905 --> 01:23:45.180
It’s terrible. But people on the whole
who are not yet corrected

01:23:45.180 --> 01:23:48.450
think they are obliging Me
by taking Realisation.

01:23:48.450 --> 01:23:50.400
This is a very common feeling
with human beings.

01:23:50.400 --> 01:23:54.660
And I feel like laughing
at the stupidity of the ego,

01:23:54.660 --> 01:23:59.550
that they are obliging Me
by taking this, um, Realisation.

01:23:59.550 --> 01:24:02.970
And the way they talk is all
on this terminology,

01:24:02.970 --> 01:24:07.560
“I came, I was sitting there
for three days, I never got Realisation.”

01:24:07.560 --> 01:24:09.630
As if I have done some criminal act.

01:24:12.709 --> 01:24:17.809
So the whole attitude of a person
gradually changes towards the Mother

01:24:17.810 --> 01:24:22.220
and he starts thinking that,
“She is here for my wellbeing.

01:24:22.220 --> 01:24:26.450
And my wellbeing is Her only concern
about me.

01:24:26.450 --> 01:24:30.830
Somehow She’ll achieve my Realization.

01:24:30.830 --> 01:24:34.129
She’s working very hard
and I must co-operate.

01:24:34.129 --> 01:24:36.409
I must learn to co-operate.

01:24:36.410 --> 01:24:41.899
It is for my heeta, for my good,
She’s doing it and I should try

01:24:41.899 --> 01:24:44.224
to understand that it is for my good.”

01:24:44.225 --> 01:24:47.209
When such an attitude is developed
it is much easier

01:24:47.209 --> 01:24:50.089
to establish a disciple.

01:24:50.090 --> 01:24:54.350
But this disciple is different
from a son or a daughter.

01:24:54.350 --> 01:25:00.530
Because Mother is a guru, no doubt,
Mother is a guru from the very beginning

01:25:00.530 --> 01:25:05.899
you are born but for a Mother
it is very difficult to be as harsh

01:25:05.899 --> 01:25:06.889
as these gurus are.

01:25:06.890 --> 01:25:10.910
Not at all, no-where near them.
One cannot beat them in the harshness.

01:25:10.910 --> 01:25:17.120
But it is for you, in your own wisdom,
to understand how to behave,

01:25:17.120 --> 01:25:21.410
how to ask for Realisation,
how to change your attitude.

01:25:21.410 --> 01:25:26.270
Because if you think too much
of yourself and you try to show off,

01:25:26.270 --> 01:25:28.580
She’ll say, “Yes, yes,
you are very great, really you are

01:25:28.580 --> 01:25:31.550
very, very great, you know.”,
till you suddenly discover

01:25:31.550 --> 01:25:33.919
that you have developed two big horns
on your head

01:25:33.919 --> 01:25:36.529
and now you are good for nothing.

01:25:36.530 --> 01:25:40.640
Then She will say, “All right,
now come along, you have developed

01:25:40.640 --> 01:25:42.590
this disease, I’ll put you right.”

01:25:42.590 --> 01:25:45.020
So better not do all those things.

01:25:45.020 --> 01:25:50.419
On one side She is willing
to go all out to save you

01:25:50.419 --> 01:25:51.499
from all troubles.

01:25:51.500 --> 01:25:53.990
Like, supposing you have
some heart trouble,

01:25:53.990 --> 01:25:57.740
if you have some any other trouble,
She’ll go all out to save you.

01:25:57.740 --> 01:25:59.390
It’s not easy to cure anybody’s heart.

01:25:59.390 --> 01:26:02.629
People think that Mother has cured us,
so it is all right, take it for granted.

01:26:02.629 --> 01:26:06.589
It’s not so. When you get Sahaja Yoga
you’ll be surprised that when you try

01:26:06.590 --> 01:26:08.750
to cure one person
you’ll fall sick for three days.

01:26:12.530 --> 01:26:13.160
Is not easy to cure!

01:26:13.160 --> 01:26:18.410
And those people, who cure,
sometimes do it through bhoots also.

01:26:18.410 --> 01:26:22.010
Those who have bhoots can also cure
because they themselves are bhoots,

01:26:22.010 --> 01:26:23.240
what can happen to the bhoots?

01:26:23.240 --> 01:26:27.740
They cure people
but put one bhoot into the patient

01:26:27.740 --> 01:26:30.380
in such a way that that patient
becomes a slave.

01:26:30.380 --> 01:26:37.400
And such bhootish people can be curer
or faith healers or anything,

01:26:37.400 --> 01:26:42.890
like supra-conscious, all sorts of people
but when they cure any person

01:26:42.890 --> 01:26:47.705
be sure they are putting another serious,
more serious problem into you.

01:26:47.705 --> 01:26:52.940
They do not cure you really;
they actually are putting some diseases

01:26:52.940 --> 01:26:57.095
into you or into the patients.
It’s a very risky game.

01:26:57.095 --> 01:27:00.050
But a Sahaja Yogi,
if he tries to cure somebody

01:27:00.050 --> 01:27:05.900
because he cannot put somebody else
in that vacuum

01:27:05.900 --> 01:27:08.510
he gets a problem himself.
He’s sucked in.

01:27:08.510 --> 01:27:17.630
So, My advice is always
for every Sahaja Yogi

01:27:17.630 --> 01:27:19.070
that you should not cure anyone.

01:27:19.070 --> 01:27:22.130
There is no need for you to cure
by touching.

01:27:22.130 --> 01:27:26.840
You should use My photograph,
you can distribute My photograph,

01:27:26.840 --> 01:27:29.450
tell people how to cure themselves.

01:27:29.450 --> 01:27:33.620
But don’t cure anybody
because you will have problems

01:27:33.620 --> 01:27:38.660
because you are not a bhoot
and your will be hit hard!

01:27:38.660 --> 01:27:42.350
So be careful about it,
don’t try to cure anyone,

01:27:42.350 --> 01:27:44.000
only use the photograph.

01:27:44.000 --> 01:27:49.280
By using the photograph
the shraddha (faith/reverence)

01:27:49.280 --> 01:27:52.610
will be there, the person will be steady
and you’ll be all right.

01:27:52.610 --> 01:27:57.110
Ah, like yesterday
we had some patient here

01:27:57.110 --> 01:28:01.670
and some people felt the compassion
for that and they all got caught up.

01:28:01.670 --> 01:28:03.770
There was no need to feel compassion.

01:28:03.770 --> 01:28:06.290
Have you got more compassion
than I have?

01:28:06.290 --> 01:28:09.380
What was the need
to bring the patient here?

01:28:09.380 --> 01:28:11.915
There was no need.
But they both got caught up.

01:28:11.915 --> 01:28:14.960
So there is no need
to bring any patients to Me.

01:28:14.960 --> 01:28:18.140
That’s not the way to behave.
Never bring any patient.

01:28:18.140 --> 01:28:22.790
If there’s a patient leave them alone.
Tell them, “Mother will look after you.

01:28:22.790 --> 01:28:25.710
We have nothing to say, you,
there’s a photograph,

01:28:25.710 --> 01:28:28.650
you must use the photograph,
get your treatment done

01:28:28.650 --> 01:28:31.140
with the photograph and you get cured.”

01:28:31.140 --> 01:28:35.370
Otherwise, first thing that will happen
to you that you’ll catch

01:28:35.370 --> 01:28:40.200
on your Center Heart
because that’s not your job.

01:28:40.200 --> 01:28:43.830
You are not to do that.
If you try to do it,

01:28:43.830 --> 01:28:46.710
actually it is your ego sometimes
that makes you think

01:28:46.710 --> 01:28:48.660
that you should cure a person, sometimes.

01:28:48.660 --> 01:28:52.470
And when you try to do through your ego
you get into trouble.

01:28:56.280 --> 01:28:58.290
Not that you cannot cure. You can.

01:28:58.290 --> 01:29:01.740
But you have to be of that level
when you try to cure a person

01:29:01.740 --> 01:29:05.850
you do not become
a supra-conscious personality,

01:29:05.850 --> 01:29:07.440
means you do not become ego-oriented.

01:29:07.440 --> 01:29:10.920
But they do, ultimately, they,
all of them, those who have tried

01:29:10.920 --> 01:29:14.340
to cure others and do like that,
they have gone out of Sahaja Yoga

01:29:14.340 --> 01:29:16.320
completely, becoming just mediums.

01:29:16.320 --> 01:29:19.050
They have become mediums,
horrible people.

01:29:19.050 --> 01:29:22.440
When they talk on the phone
I feel somebody’s pouring poison

01:29:22.440 --> 01:29:23.370
into my ears.

01:29:23.370 --> 01:29:25.590
They are so horrid
that you can’t imagine.

01:29:25.590 --> 01:29:30.390
So, it is important for people
who get Realisation

01:29:30.390 --> 01:29:34.890
not to indulge into any curing
because they will develop

01:29:34.890 --> 01:29:36.120
this Center Heart very much.

01:29:36.120 --> 01:29:41.940
Center Heart can be developed
in countries where there’s all fear,

01:29:41.940 --> 01:29:43.560
people are frightened.

01:29:43.560 --> 01:29:48.960
It can be developed by other things
by which people are frightened.

01:29:48.960 --> 01:29:52.920
Reading books of bad gurus
and reading the books

01:29:52.920 --> 01:29:56.580
about shocking things,
like many people who read

01:29:56.580 --> 01:30:00.038
the Kundalini’s book
have got Center Heart

01:30:00.038 --> 01:30:01.740
(Shri Mataji laughing)
because they are so frightened

01:30:01.740 --> 01:30:03.090
about the Kundalini.

01:30:03.090 --> 01:30:05.970
Anything that frightens you
if you read

01:30:05.970 --> 01:30:10.440
can make your heart very, very weak
and dangerous.

01:30:10.440 --> 01:30:13.950
Now we have two other sides
to this Center Heart,

01:30:13.950 --> 01:30:17.610
is the Mother’s Heart,
is Her own brother, is Vishnu,

01:30:17.610 --> 01:30:20.670
takes incarnation as Shri Rama
on the Right Heart,

01:30:20.670 --> 01:30:27.720
who we think is Father
who is looking after His children.

01:30:27.720 --> 01:30:30.900
So that is the Father
and this is the Mother.

01:30:30.900 --> 01:30:35.670
Though here the Father and the Mother
are in two aspects,

01:30:35.670 --> 01:30:42.150
that the Mother is the, ah,
Sister of the Father

01:30:42.150 --> 01:30:47.700
and Father is the Mama of the disciples,
of the sadhakas.

01:30:47.700 --> 01:30:51.780
The Mama is a greater father
than a father, as you all know.

01:30:51.780 --> 01:31:00.690
And so this Uncle
who is the incarnation of Shri Narayana

01:31:00.690 --> 01:31:08.850
looks after the protected, aah,
disciples of the Mother.

01:31:08.850 --> 01:31:16.410
He gives that father’s understanding
to the children

01:31:16.410 --> 01:31:25.500
because at this stage, this Father,
God Almighty, is not known, who is Shiva.

01:31:25.500 --> 01:31:31.740
So this Uncle looks after the children
till they are grown up enough

01:31:31.740 --> 01:31:33.120
to meet their Father.

01:31:33.120 --> 01:31:40.170
And that is how we can say
that Parvati or Uma or Devi,

01:31:40.170 --> 01:31:44.040
She comes to Her Mother’s place,
maika (maternal home/abode)

01:31:44.040 --> 01:31:48.900
and resides in this Center Heart
and there Her brother

01:31:48.900 --> 01:31:50.040
protects Her children.

01:31:50.040 --> 01:31:54.720
When She gives Realisation to children
or gives them second birth

01:31:54.720 --> 01:32:00.720
then this Mama looks after
the Sister’s children

01:32:00.720 --> 01:32:07.050
and helps them to build up
the security of a father.

01:32:07.050 --> 01:32:14.910
So the right side of every human being
represents the fatherhood,

01:32:14.910 --> 01:32:21.390
the father and the fatherhood of a man
is very important.

01:32:21.390 --> 01:32:26.760
If this center is spoilt
or if there’s something wrong with it,

01:32:26.760 --> 01:32:30.840
then you get asthma as a disease.

01:32:30.840 --> 01:32:36.720
Asthma is only caused by this center
being spoilt

01:32:36.720 --> 01:32:39.180
or some other combinations
with this center.

01:32:39.180 --> 01:32:42.630
Asthma is very common
among girls and boys.

01:32:42.630 --> 01:32:47.250
And, the relationship with the father
or the understanding of the father

01:32:47.250 --> 01:32:52.860
or your own fatherhood is not all right
you get this trouble of asthma

01:32:52.860 --> 01:32:57.180
and for that one has to ask
the questions to the sadhakas,

01:32:57.180 --> 01:32:59.070
what sort of a father you have?

01:32:59.070 --> 01:33:03.590
As one gentleman came and asked Me,
“Why everybody’s asking me

01:33:03.590 --> 01:33:05.510
what sort of a father you have?

01:33:05.510 --> 01:33:08.900
What sort of a, everybody asked me,
what about your father,

01:33:08.900 --> 01:33:11.870
what about your father?
What has my father to do with me?”

01:33:11.870 --> 01:33:16.220
Actually everybody feels the Right Heart
and they have to ask about the father

01:33:16.220 --> 01:33:19.640
because father resides
in the Right Heart.

01:33:19.640 --> 01:33:23.150
And the principle of fatherhood,
if it is spoilt,

01:33:23.150 --> 01:33:26.210
if there is a problem
with the principle of fatherhood,

01:33:26.210 --> 01:33:30.395
then you get this problem
and many other problems, ah,

01:33:30.395 --> 01:33:33.140
which I do not want to discuss
now at length.

01:33:33.140 --> 01:33:35.870
But you can understand
a person who has no father,

01:33:35.870 --> 01:33:40.400
how diffident he is and how he behaves,
and also such people,

01:33:40.400 --> 01:33:43.730
those who have not known a father
can become very wayward,

01:33:43.730 --> 01:33:48.260
licentious or permissive,
or could be very much

01:33:48.260 --> 01:33:51.320
secretly licentious.

01:33:51.320 --> 01:33:56.300
The people who lose their father
do not have that lacking, a lacking,

01:33:56.300 --> 01:34:00.245
they lack in that discipline
that the father gives them.

01:34:00.245 --> 01:34:05.420
Or could be, such, ah, people
could take to a very remorse

01:34:05.420 --> 01:34:06.560
and unhappy life.

01:34:06.560 --> 01:34:10.040
Or they could be very hard
on their children

01:34:10.040 --> 01:34:12.710
or could be extremely kind
and spoil the children.

01:34:12.710 --> 01:34:14.045
It could be any way.

01:34:14.045 --> 01:34:19.970
So it has of both the reactions, ah,
either, ah, too much of love-giving

01:34:19.970 --> 01:34:23.330
or too much of strictness.
It can be anything.

01:34:23.330 --> 01:34:29.240
Or a person could be, ah, of this kind,
may be very strict in childhood

01:34:29.240 --> 01:34:31.730
and could be extremely lavish
in old age.

01:34:31.730 --> 01:34:34.790
It’s a, it is a very
imbalanced personality.

01:34:34.790 --> 01:34:38.600
So the person who has no father
has to know that his father

01:34:38.600 --> 01:34:41.690
is Shri Rama.
He should not worry about anything.

01:34:41.690 --> 01:34:47.090
He is the One, with one, ah, arrow
He can kill any number of people.

01:34:47.090 --> 01:34:54.680
So he should have no fear, at all
about his father not being there

01:34:54.680 --> 01:34:57.830
or father being dead
or something happening like that.

01:34:57.830 --> 01:35:01.550
On the contrary if the father is dead
it’s better to tell him

01:35:01.550 --> 01:35:06.020
not to worry about, ah, you
and that you are all right

01:35:06.020 --> 01:35:10.220
so that you leave your father in peace
and ask him to take his birth

01:35:10.220 --> 01:35:12.350
than to bind him to this earth.

01:35:12.350 --> 01:35:16.520
This is the Right Heart
and the Left Heart is the mother,

01:35:16.520 --> 01:35:19.400
actually your own mother,
whosoever it is.

01:35:19.400 --> 01:35:23.930
That is the motherhood in the sense
that if your mother has been

01:35:23.930 --> 01:35:31.310
extremely unkind and extremely funny
or your relationship with mother is bad,

01:35:31.310 --> 01:35:35.690
then know that there’s something wrong
on the Left Heart, ah,

01:35:35.690 --> 01:35:38.090
which is indicated in you.

01:35:38.090 --> 01:35:41.930
So these two points are very important
in human beings.

01:35:41.930 --> 01:35:47.390
If a Sahaja Yogi just decides that,
“I have a Father and a Mother;

01:35:47.390 --> 01:35:51.020
God Almighty is my Father
and my Mother”

01:35:51.020 --> 01:35:55.010
then these problems
can be easily solved.

01:35:55.010 --> 01:35:57.800
But in Sahaja Yoga
it is not what you think

01:35:57.800 --> 01:35:59.300
that works out, it does not.

01:35:59.300 --> 01:36:01.610
Like in the car if you sit down
and think that,

01:36:01.610 --> 01:36:03.230
“I am going to Connaught Place”,
you won’t move.

01:36:03.230 --> 01:36:04.910
You have to move your hands.

01:36:04.910 --> 01:36:08.300
In the same way in Sahaja Yoga
you have to move your hands.

01:36:08.300 --> 01:36:11.825
Clear you chakras, move them higher
and put them up.

01:36:11.825 --> 01:36:15.170
It’s not what you think is important
in Sahaja Yoga. Not at all!

01:36:15.170 --> 01:36:19.340
You may think, ah, that,
“I’m doing very well in Sahaja Yoga,

01:36:19.340 --> 01:36:20.720
I’m very good”, but it’s not so.

01:36:20.720 --> 01:36:26.750
It is what you actually achieve;
your ascent is the point.

01:36:26.750 --> 01:36:30.770
So, as in the car, as I told you,
you cannot just sit down and think

01:36:30.770 --> 01:36:31.790
and do the job.

01:36:31.790 --> 01:36:36.560
In the same way, you have to run
this machine and you have to see

01:36:36.560 --> 01:36:39.140
that you get all this movement.

01:36:39.140 --> 01:36:41.120
There should be gati (pace/momentum)
in you.

01:36:41.120 --> 01:36:45.620
Otherwise, there is no sense
in just talking about Sahaja Yoga,

01:36:45.620 --> 01:36:50.390
thinking about Sahaja Yoga, and, eh,
convincing yourself that you are

01:36:50.390 --> 01:36:51.200
a great Sahaja Yogi.

01:36:51.200 --> 01:36:56.330
It is how you manifest it is the point,
which very few people understand.

01:36:56.330 --> 01:37:00.350
Very, very few people understand
that it has to be manifesting,

01:37:00.350 --> 01:37:02.210
it has to be kaaryaanvit
(to bring into effective action).

01:37:02.210 --> 01:37:05.630
It is not just talk, talk, talk,
talk, talk, talk morning till evening.

01:37:05.630 --> 01:37:10.070
Even when I’m talking now
I’m opening your heart, Heart Center.

01:37:10.070 --> 01:37:14.180
I’m working it. Even I’m talking,
also I’m opening. It’s working.

01:37:14.180 --> 01:37:19.659
You will see your Heart Chakra is open
by the time I finish My lecture.

01:37:19.660 --> 01:37:22.300
It is so because I know how to do it.

01:37:22.300 --> 01:37:25.450
When I talk I’m just watching
where the chakras are catching,

01:37:25.450 --> 01:37:27.670
what’s happening
and I’m catching all these points

01:37:27.670 --> 01:37:29.560
and touching it and trying to open it.

01:37:29.560 --> 01:37:33.100
And that’s how it should be,
that even when you talk

01:37:33.100 --> 01:37:34.810
it should be kaaryaanvit.

01:37:34.810 --> 01:37:37.420
Even when you are quiet
and raising hands

01:37:37.420 --> 01:37:38.260
it should be kaaryaanvit.

01:37:38.260 --> 01:37:40.210
Whatever you do,
you should be kaaryaanvit.

01:37:40.210 --> 01:37:43.330
Even if you glance at anyone
it should be kaaryaanvit,

01:37:43.330 --> 01:37:49.090
it should not be just a, eh,
kind of a jabbering that we do

01:37:49.090 --> 01:37:50.320
sometimes about Sahaja Yoga.

01:37:50.320 --> 01:37:56.950
The greatest fear human beings have
that they think they have done

01:37:56.950 --> 01:38:00.610
lots of mistakes
and these mistakes are too many,

01:38:00.610 --> 01:38:05.410
and they can never get Realization,
they’ll be doomed,

01:38:05.410 --> 01:38:06.490
they’ll be going to hell.

01:38:06.490 --> 01:38:09.925
This is not true, at all true.

01:38:09.925 --> 01:38:14.275
Nobody is going to go hell
if they you do not want to.

01:38:14.275 --> 01:38:17.620
If you want to stop it, you can stop it.
The time has come.

01:38:17.620 --> 01:38:21.040
You are going to be blessed
and blessed forever.

01:38:21.040 --> 01:38:23.860
So may God bless you!

01:38:23.860 --> 01:38:28.480
Today’s lecture I’ve given you, ah,
in a way that you should understand

01:38:28.480 --> 01:38:32.170
importance of confidence
but not by saying, “I am confident.”

01:38:32.170 --> 01:38:36.070
because when you say outwardly
you are actually egoistical.

01:38:36.070 --> 01:38:42.280
But when you say in your vibrations,
then you are confident.

01:38:42.280 --> 01:38:44.980
May God bless you all!

01:38:44.980 --> 01:38:47.980
Today I’m sorry I have to go
for a dinner tonight

01:38:47.980 --> 01:38:52.810
and I won’t be able to spend much time
today for touching Feet,

01:38:52.810 --> 01:38:57.220
because yesterday My brother came home
for dinner and I reached 11 o’clock

01:38:57.220 --> 01:38:58.450
so he went away without eating food.

01:38:58.450 --> 01:39:01.630
Again today he’s coming
so I hope today you’ll excuse Me

01:39:01.630 --> 01:39:04.840
for My brother
because after all I must look after

01:39:04.840 --> 01:39:15.489
your Mama also sometimes (Laughter).

01:39:15.490 --> 01:39:17.580
May God bless you!

01:39:17.580 --> 01:39:20.460
Tomorrow I’ll talk to you
about Vishuddhi Chakra, ah,

01:39:20.460 --> 01:39:23.700
which I will start exactly at 6.30.

01:39:23.700 --> 01:39:27.810
I hope you make it convenient to Me
and exactly at 6.30 we start our program

01:39:27.810 --> 01:39:29.852
tomorrow, exactly at 6.30.

01:39:29.852 --> 01:39:32.370
(Shri Mataji speaks in Hindi
a few words.)

01:39:36.300 --> 01:39:40.500
Those who do not obey suffer.
You should not. Once I’ve said it,

01:39:40.500 --> 01:39:43.200
what is there?
Obedience, why is it difficult?

01:39:43.200 --> 01:39:48.750
Why is it difficult to obey?
It is just try and obey

01:39:48.750 --> 01:39:52.470
and you’ll find it,
obedience gives you the real confidence,

01:39:52.470 --> 01:39:58.380
is obedience, just obedience.
Just try. Just try to obey.

01:39:58.380 --> 01:39:59.460
It’s very simple.

01:39:59.460 --> 01:40:02.640
And said today no touching of Feet
is all right.

01:40:02.640 --> 01:40:06.360
For Indians it is difficult,
but if in English, if I say,

01:40:06.360 --> 01:40:08.430
“You touch My Feet” they will not,
they say, “Who are You?”

01:40:08.430 --> 01:40:13.080
(Shri Mataji laughs).

01:40:13.080 --> 01:40:16.470
You laugh at them and they laugh at you.
That’s what it is.

01:40:17.340 --> 01:40:19.620
So today you become Englishmen.

01:40:19.620 --> 01:40:22.500
Thank you very much.

